---
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "~/components/Section.astro";
import CardGrid from "~/components/CardGrid.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Community"
  description="Where ShedOS is discussed, debugged, and built."
>

  <section class="grid-bg" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="container page-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Community</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top:.9rem;">Community</h1>
      <p class="lead">ShedOS lives on GitHub — issues, discussions, and the full source.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Section>
    <CardGrid cols={2}>
      <article class="card linkcard">
        <h3>Report a bug</h3>
        <p>Something broken? Open an issue with your ShedOS version (<code class="code-inline">pacman -Qi shedos-meta</code>), <code class="code-inline">shedman status</code> output, and what you expected.</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/Theshedman/shedos/issues/new">Open an issue →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card linkcard">
        <h3>Discuss and ask</h3>
        <p>Questions, ideas, setups, and "is this normal?" — GitHub Discussions is the long-form home.</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/Theshedman/shedos/discussions">Join the discussion →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card linkcard">
        <h3>Contribute</h3>
        <p>The whole OS is one repository: packages, installer, desktop, and this site. Changes under <code class="code-inline">packaging/</code> ship through CI to every machine.</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="https://github.com/Theshedman/shedos">Read the source →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card linkcard">
        <h3>Test the next release</h3>
        <p>Run the testing ISO during a release-candidate window and you're soaking the next stable before it ships. Testing builds appear on the download page when one is newer than stable.</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="download.html">Get the testing build →</a>
      </article>
    </CardGrid>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:3.5rem;">Good bug reports</h2>
    <div class="dlbox" style="margin-top:1.2rem;padding:1.4rem 1.6rem;">
      <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem;">
        <li>ShedOS version: <code class="code-inline">pacman -Qi shedos-meta</code></li>
        <li>The aggregated state: <code class="code-inline">shedman status --json</code></li>
        <li>For desktop issues: <code class="code-inline">hyprctl version</code> and which keybinding or gesture misbehaved</li>
        <li>For update issues: the last entries of <code class="code-inline">shedman upgrade-history --list</code></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </Section>

</BaseLayout>
